  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: 784d78f741f159b4fa345687039dccf0, type: 3}
  Interactable: {fileID: 5048261325816738630, guid: 784d78f741f159b4fa345687039dccf0, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - 
  - "No easy way to say this. I\u2019ll have to stay at the South Pole a little longer.\nI\u2019m
    sorry, Bear. I know you\u2019re disappointed. I am too.\nDid you know Antarctica
    means \u201Cthe land with no bears,\u201D while Arctic means \u201Cland of bears\u201D?
    Most people think it refers to polar bears, but the names come from the constellations
    Ursa Major and Ursa Minor. Down here I can\u2019t see them at all.\nI don\u2019t
    see you either, Little Bear. But whether I see the stars or not, I know they\u2019re
    there. And I know you are too.\nWe\u2019re like that constellation\u2014far apart,
    yet still held together by the same story.\n\nLove you,\nUrsa Major"
